message: "If you publish results obtained with these modules, please cite this repository."
title: "insarwatch-code"
abstract: >-
  Dependency-free Python calculators for geotechnical engineering, surveying and
  InSAR monitoring. Seven stdlib-only modules that reproduce the free online
  calculators at insarwatch.com to better than 0.1 %.
type: software
authors:
