url: "https://insarwatch.com"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
keywords:
  - geotechnical engineering
  - InSAR
  - slope stability
  - soil mechanics
  - Atterberg limits
  - surveying
  - leveling
